  "all_text": "EMILY JOHNSON\nCONTACT E-mail: emily.johnson@example.com\nPhone number: 555-555-666\nLinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/emilyjohnson\nPROFILE\nBusiness Intelligence Developer with over 5 years of experience in building dashboards, automating reports, and supporting data-driven decision-making. Strong background in Power BI, SQL, and Excel, with basic exposure to SAP BW. Detail- oriented, analytical, and highly collaborative, seeking opportunities to grow in enterprise BI environments.\nWORK EXPERIENCE\nBI DEVELOPER Business Insights July 2019 - Present\nDesign and develop dashboards and business reports in Power BI and Excel. Support stakeholders by gathering reporting requirements, preparing data models, and ensuring data accuracy across BI solutions. Collaborate with data engineering teams on data consistency and quality improvements. Limited exposure to SAP BW (primarily data extraction and navigation) with no hands- on ABAP development responsibilities.\nEDUCATION\nB.A. Business Administration 2014 - 2018 University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign\nCompleted graduate-level coursework in data analysis, statistical modeling, data visualization, and business intelligence tools. Gained strong foundations in SQL, analytical thinking, and building data-driven solutions to support organizational decision-making.\nSKILLS\nPower BI, Excel, SQL, Reporting"
